	(text "LM74700 + BSC014N06NS (60 V, 1.45 mOhm) ideal diode after each fuse: a reversed supply is blocked\ninstead of crowbarring the TVS.\nAbout 0.6 W per FET at 20 A. Zn_F is the fused input; VZn the zone rail.\nThe zone TVS and OR diodes sit on VZn; the blown-fuse LEDs read across the fuse only (Jn_IN to Zn_F)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 302.26 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fd0f0097-6e75-4195-89e7-074710716670"))
